        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GVCPRTCOM, Grande Victorian Portofino Lever Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Grande Victorian Portofino Lever Single Cylinder Combo is reminiscent of the late 1800's door hardware styles. Fit for royalty, it has an elaborate yet graceful victorian design. The Grande Victorian Plate features luxurious detailing that exudes richness. This lockset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—its ornate styling is perfect for fancier home décors. The Portofino Lever's simple lines draw attention to the beautiful detailing on the rose and deadbolt. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Grande Victorian Entry Set With Portofino Lever fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-grande-victorian-series\"><b>Grande Victorian Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grande Victorian Portofino Lever Single Cylinder Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grande Victorian Portofino Lever Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Height: 8.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.42\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.76\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GVC-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Grande Victorian Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GVC-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Grande Victorian Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
